{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41644","headline":"独摇手 · 陈陶","name":"独摇手","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉宫新燕矜蛾眉，春台艳妆莲一枝。\n迎春侍宴瑶华池，游龙七盘娇欲飞。\n冶袖莺鸾拂朝曦，摩烟褭雪金碧遗。\n愁鸿连翾蚕曳丝，飒遝明珠掌中移。\n仙人龙凤云雨吹，朝哀暮愁引哑吚。\n鸳鸯翡翠承宴私，南山一笑君无辞。\n仙蛾泣月清露垂，六宫烧烛愁风欷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}